<% content_for :preview_text do %><%= @exchange_name %> is not happening after all. Nothing needed from you.<% end %>

<h1 style="margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #18181b;">
  <%= @exchange_name %> has been called off.
</h1>
<p style="margin: 0 0 24px 0; font-size: 16px; color: #52525b;">
  Plans change. Gift exchanges, occasionally, un-exchange.
</p>
<p style="margin: 0 0 24px 0; font-size: 14px; color: #52525b;">
  <strong><%= @owner_name %></strong> cancelled <strong><%= @exchange_name %></strong>,
  so there is nothing you need to do. Any match you had is off, and your
  wishlist ideas from this exchange are gone with it.
</p>
<p style="margin: 32px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px; color: #71717a; text-align: center;">
  If a new exchange gets organized, you&rsquo;ll get a fresh invite.
</p>
